Support raw audio/video output in NUT container

Write a simple raw output form.  Useful fallback when AVFoundation is absent,
or you just wanted the raw frames and audio.  Produces uncompressed rgb48le
video and pcm_f32le audio in the NUT container format:
https://git.ffmpeg.org/gitweb/nut.git/blob_plain/HEAD:/docs/nut.txt
